{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19224","headline":"浙东元相公书叹梅雨郁蒸之候因寄七言 · 刘禹锡","name":"浙东元相公书叹梅雨郁蒸之候因寄七言","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"稽山自与岐山别，何事连年鸑鷟飞。\n百辟商量旧相入，九天祗候老臣归。\n平湖晚泛窥清镜，高阁晨开扫翠微。\n今日看书最惆怅，爲闻梅雨损朝衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19224.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19224","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}